{"agent_id":"6Vw9","agent_seq":617,"timestamp":"2026-08-21T07:56:03.178923628Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"c95948bb-711e-46e1-b757-cd7dba65d754","title":"Stop treating Rust todo module names as stub patterns","description":"The customized PostToolUse stub detector flags legitimate lines such as 'mod todo;' and 'pub use todo::{...}' as TODO comments after unrelated edits to src/tools/mod.rs. It demands replacement of real production modules and creates misleading intervention output. Match actual TODO/FIXME comment syntax rather than raw substring 'todo'. Discovered during S-003 issue #1064.","priority":"low","created_by":"6Vw9"},"signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHsAxzF9kIbve7/K8QmdChLc2iNRGYPvarGBOH1GBUSVoKm2bl1dH9Cc/PZsNr7ozi6C6Hu7t2cvHHJATDkb9Qo="}
