{"agent_id":"6Vw9","agent_seq":621,"timestamp":"2026-08-21T08:22:56.296715136Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"706dcde7-cad4-4d11-b9bd-ee4d23d4158f","comment_uuid":"509a3db2-9b13-4a00-8070-7830fb2d783a","author":"6Vw9","content":"Full-suite containment finding: ordinary cargo test with the fuzz manifest creates the official fuzz/target cache, but the versioned evidence-freshness walker excludes only repository-root target. The 3.1 GiB ignored fuzz cache was therefore hashed as source, crossed the 1 GiB fail-closed ceiling, poisoned nine unrelated quality/final-gate tests, and stretched process timeout tests. S-003 requires a new versioned source-tree policy that excludes exact fuzz runtime and build outputs while continuing to hash curated seed-prefixed corpus files and similarly named nested source paths. Tests must prove both sides. This is necessary for an operational fuzz harness and is not being waived as runner flakiness.","created_at":"2026-08-21T08:22:56.294255323Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAxJpO2DLnwFTy7wyTn6oj3wI2psGHWpuMhv79AxKkQi2fvmzNDxyAwmZ98oy6ivGBwsRgdHNGj/oBf5QN5szjDw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC5qHd61dUc8p4dkS9FFRZhd+4iVYqctO5dUV+uTu8THlO6Vj0DckUIWlMx4V05m/vGex3AfeTxe8xFID079uwg="}
