{"agent_id":"6Vw9","agent_seq":625,"timestamp":"2026-08-21T08:34:51.434913457Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"4956e2e0-fc51-452d-9b2d-da82b99f33b6","title":"Reap sandbox processes left by bash background tests","description":"Repeated full Rust test runs leave one bwrap process from tests/bash_background_e2e.rs alive at the spawn-7 case. Five observed processes had no child, waited in do_wait_intr_irq, shared parent PID 1447, and ranged from six minutes to over one day old. The suite still exits successfully, so the leak is invisible to test status. Add deterministic child and sandbox teardown assertions and ensure every background run is reaped on success, failure, timeout, and panic.","priority":"medium","created_by":"6Vw9"},"signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQN+VOxLrUOvQS+Ac9xGtHOywBDavEmzbiiuf743MXRJHIFmpG0tHYTX8k72ZkJSUlR6M0IaO1CpQFlDNGRPYYgs="}
